WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, here's what people
are talking about, you guys.

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yesterday was Easter
and April Fool's.

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:05.705 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Which makes sense.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
It makes sense,
'cause Easter was the day

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:10.276
when Jesus came back and
was like, "April Fool's."

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:13.079 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And they go, "Oh."

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this morning,
the White House

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
hosted their annual
Easter Egg Roll.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.450 line:92%
When President Trump first heard

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
there were a bunch of bunnies
on the front lawn,

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
he told his lawyer
to pay them off.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.924 line:92%
He's like, "Make this go away."

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.694 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
During the event,
Trump made some remarks

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
while standing next
to the Easter bunny.

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.600 line:92%
Take a look at this picture.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.634 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.269 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:38.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was right after
the Easter bunny

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.639 line:92%
was told that he'd been fired.

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:42.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
So you can tell.
He was like...

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:44.778 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:46.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
Through the mask,
the bunny told Trump,

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
[Russian accent] "This is last
favor I do for you, Donald.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.052 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No more favors.

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.520 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Heh. Happy Easter."

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normal voice ]
At the same event,

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:57.257 line:92%
Education Secretary Betsy DeVos

00:00:57.257 --> 00:01:00.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
read a book to a group
of little kids.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was a sweet moment
when one of the kids said,

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:05.165 size:81% position:41%
"Sound it out, Betsy.
You can do it. Just...

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:09.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
Very cl--
I think I can, I think I can."

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:12.539
During his speech, Trump was
talking about the White House.

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:16.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think he forgot what
it was called. Watch this.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.479 line:92%
-...keep this incredible house

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:22.282 size:84% position:42%
or building or whatever
you want to call it,

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:24.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
because there really is
no name for it.

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:26.586 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It is special.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.822 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:31.191 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:34.360 line:92%
-"It's a house. It is white.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's why I call it
'the big building.'

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:40.700 size:75% position:38%
It's a very special,
big, special place.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.368 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Right, Easter bunny?

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:43.002 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:45.872
I want to thank this incredible
creature next to me,

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.474 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
this big-eared rat.

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:49.709 size:78% position:39% line:92%
This albino squirrel.

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:51.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whatever you --
There's no name for him.

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:55.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whatever you want to call him,
he's a very special thing."

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:58.051 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:58.651 --> 00:01:59.352 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And did you see this?

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:02.255
A photo of President Trump with
all the White House interns

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:05.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
is going viral, because of
its lack of diversity.

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:06.793 size:78% position:39%
This is a real photo.
Take a look at this.

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:10.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ooh, boy.
Not a lot of diversity there.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:12.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
But to get a better sense
of the situation,

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.901
let's see what some of
the interns are thinking.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:18.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
For instance,
this intern said...

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:25.078
That's -- That's diverse.
-Yeah, that's diverse.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:26.646 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:30.016 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-This intern said...

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:38.525 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
This intern said...

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:42.228 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:46.232 line:92%
And finally this intern said...

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:48.368 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:50.603 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:53.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
Get this -- President Trump
has declared April

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:57.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
National Sexual Assault
Awareness Month...

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:59.012 line:92%
which means April is also

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:01.714 size:78% position:39%
National Presidential
Unawareness Month.

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.783 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's like...

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:05.185 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:06.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
This weekend,
President Trump tweeted

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Mexico isn't doing enough
to stop people

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:11.024 size:88% position:44% line:92%
from crossing the border

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:13.026 line:92%
and threatened to end NAFTA.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:14.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then Mexican
presidential candidate

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:18.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
Andrés Manuel López Obrador
issued a response.

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:19.499 size:88% position:44% line:92%
This is real. He said...

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:22.302 size:81% position:41%
"Mexico and its people
will not be the piñata

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:24.871 line:92%
of any foreign government."

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:27.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then Britain's
prime minister added...

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.074 line:92%
"Nor will Britain and its people

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:31.678
be the Cadbury Crèème Egg
of any foreign government."

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.846 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:37.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then Obrador replied...
"Just to be clear,

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
the metaphor wasn't really
about candy.

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was just about
being something

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.288 line:92%
that people blindly attack."

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:46.025
Then Switzerland's president
said, "Totally, and I agree --

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:47.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
no nation should be
the Toblerone

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:50.096 line:92%
of any foreign government."

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:53.399 line:92%
To which Obrador replied,

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:03.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
President Trump said,

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:07.513
"Wait. Mexico's got candy?
Let's break down the wall!

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.415 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:12.151 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Break it down!"

00:04:12.619 --> 00:04:15.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
This weekend,
the movie "Ready Player One"

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:15.989 size:81% position:41% line:92%
topped the box office.

00:04:15.989 --> 00:04:18.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's about a world
where people escape reality

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:19.659 line:92%
by playing a computer game.

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:21.894
When Americans were asked
if they'd ever be sucked

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:23.429 line:92%
into a digital world like that,

00:04:23.429 --> 00:04:25.431 line:92%
they said, "One sec. Sorry.

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:29.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
What? What's that?
Sorry. I'm so sorry."

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:30.336 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Cackles ]

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:32.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
Today, the Yankees
had to postpone

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:35.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
their home opener
because of a snowstorm.

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:36.609 line:92%
You could tell it was cold

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:39.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause the foot-long hot dogs
were only 5 inches.

00:04:39.946 --> 00:04:41.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ho! Ho!

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:45.785 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:47.153 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey!

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:48.988 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Ho! [ Laughs ]

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:51.491 line:92%
-Seventh-inning shrinkage.

00:04:51.491 --> 00:04:53.559 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Two balls, one strike.

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:56.429 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:03.870 line:92%
-Didn't even get to first base.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:06.606 size:81% position:41%
Some celebrity news --
Khloé Kardashian says

00:05:06.606 --> 00:05:10.310
she can't wait to go to the gym
after her baby is born.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then every other
new parent was like,

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:13.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Yeah, let us know
how that plan works out.

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:17.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, that -- You'll be
at the gym all of the time."

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:20.486
I heard about an 80-year-old man
in Arizona

00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:22.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
who is on trial
for robbing a bank.

00:05:22.889 --> 00:05:25.124
Apparently he slipped the teller
a note that said,

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:27.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Do you know
why I came in here?"

00:05:27.727 --> 00:05:29.696 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.696 --> 00:05:33.032
And finally, it just came out
that Pope Francis once said

00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:35.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
that there is no such thing
as hell.

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:39.038
Then he got stuck in boarding
group C on Spirit Airlines

00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:40.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
and said,
"Never mind. I found it."

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:44.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have a great show tonight.
Give it up for The Roots!

